pported</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Retain non-submittable working-draft status</p></content></td></tr></table><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="474" width="864" height="30" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(220,247,238,1)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="477" width="840" height="24"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,158,132,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" ><p>Next step must be a feasible discriminating experiment or dataset audit, not another inventory or a claim upgrade.</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="510" width="810" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="7" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(105,119,135,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>Source: RK38 clean closeout 21e9ba813d87 · scope remains inventory-only · manuscript remains non-submittable</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="886" topLeftY="507" width="28" height="17"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="true" textAlign="right" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>186</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body"><p>RK38 closes an engineering and evidence-inventory gap, not the core scientific gates.</p><p>External SOTA, unified time matching and untouched confirmation remain false.</p><p>Functional robustness, protein OOD, prospective DBTL and generator evidence are still unresolved.</p><p>The next step must supply discriminating scientific evidence rather than another inventory.</p></content></note></slide>